cribed Form\"**.\n*   **Section 9:** (Modification) Requires amendments or modifications to be reduced to writing in the **\"Prescribed Form\"**.\n\n#### Appendix A – Definitions\n*   **\"Domestic Content Level\":** (Removal) Definition deleted.\n*   **\"Minimum Required Domestic Content Level\":** (Removal) Definition deleted.\n*   **\"Prescribed Form\":** (Addition) New definition: \"means, in relation to a form, the latest version of the corresponding form appearing on the Website...\"\n*   **\"Website\":** (Addition) New definition: \"means the OPA’s Renewable Energy Feed-In Tariff Program website at 'http://microfit.powerauthority.on.ca'...\"\n*   **\"Project Eligibility Requirements (c)\":** (Modification) Added \"unless otherwise consented to by the OPA in writing in its sole and absolute discretion\" regarding facilities that have previously reached commercial operation.\n\n#### Appendix C – Solar Photovoltaic Schedule\n*   **Defined Term \"Existing Building\":** (Modification) Expanded to include buildings for which the OPA has issued written confirmation (at its sole discretion) that the building is deemed an \"Existing Building\".\n*   **Domestic Content Requirements (Sections 1.1 through 1.7):** (Removal) Entire section deleted, including rules for calculating Qualifying Percentages and requirements for evidence.\n*   **Tables 1, 2, and 3:** (Removal) The \"Domestic Content Grids\" for Crystalline Silicon, Thin-Film, and Concentrated PV Technologies (pages 17-19 of v2.0) are completely removed in v3.1.1.\n\n#### Appendix E – LDC Supplier Schedule\n*   **Section 3.1(a):** (Typographical Modification) Changed \"orders-in-council\" to \"orders- in-council\" (added a space)."}, :node-id #uuid "f3d2709f-d7b1-4709-8ea9-1d31bab67d8f", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-started, :sheet-id #uuid "b6096d4a-c55a-4e59-9948-bbefda19edda", :event/id #uuid "019e431e-8805-7005-a2c4-016567862e1d"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Ye8w3Ibdqiit5EMbutJsBOJOZ2E10", :mulog/timestamp 1779242534917, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Ye8w3Ibdqiit5EMbutJsBOJOZ2E10", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
